"            Hello,<br/>\n"
"            <b><t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/></b><b>'s</b> cheuqe reference no.<b><t t-out=\"object.reference\"/></b> due on <b><t t-out=\"object.due_date\"/></b>.<br/>\n"
